key BackSpace
bs-delete on
key BackSpace
bs-delete off
key Tab
key KP_Tab
key ISO_Left_Tab
key Linefeed
key Clear
key Sys_Req
key Escape
key Return
key KP_Enter
key Find
key Insert
key Delete
key Select
key Pause
key Scroll_Lock
key KP_Space
key 0xffff
key 0xffff uni="x"
